<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Southern Fury, 2010</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY text=#dcdcdc bgColor=#2b2b2b scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;United Kingdom&amp;nbsp;vs. Argentina&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto"&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face=Calibri&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&amp;nbsp;10&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; November, 2010/ 08:00:00 Zulu&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; South Atlantic&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;1.5 Days&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Sides:&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;United Kingdom&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;Situation&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;The discovery of vast reserves of oil on Tierra Del Fuego and the waters around Isla de Los Estados resulted in an enormous boost to Argentina’s economy. A moderate government was elected, and a huge undertaking of modernisation and social reform was instigated. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;The government has abolished conscription and turned the military into a smaller but more professional force. However, the reforms could not reach the people at the rate to which the media had raised their expectations. Civil unrest, starting in the countryside, quickly spread to the cities and martial law was established on 7 July 2005. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;By 1 September the civil government had lost nearly all powers to the military and on 10 September a right-wing military junta lead by General Alfonso Pollocko, a veteran of the Falklands Conflict, seized power. Opposition parties were banned, and conscription was re-introduced. Despite strong objections and an attempt at sanctions by the UN, the new junta continued to build up its military from the revenue gained from the oilfields. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Argentina invaded Chilean Tierra Del Fuego to gain access to the rest of the oil reserves. Although no action has yet been taken, the junta has made specific threats regarding the Jason oil fields (JOF), some 30nm west of the Falkland Islands. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;All military leave has been cancelled and a large increase in troop movements (Marine infantry) has been noted in the area of Puerto Belgrano. An amphibious task group sailed from Puerto Belgrano overnight on 6/7th November and remains unlocated.&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #323d4f; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;The United Kingdom after years of neglect has limited assets to counter any action against the Falkland Islands. The Royal Navy has&amp;nbsp;mustered a Task Force centred on HMS Ark Royal and the RAF have bolstered RAF Mount Pleasant with additional Typhoons and a detachment of Tornado GR.4's.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;Paul Bridge&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face=Calibri&gt;Author and Scenario Designer&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
